Version 0.3.0

   o fixed null-model and Gamma handling in ndr
   o added textual association types and methods, Gaussian-rank and biweight correlations
   o added FDR-adjusted tests, multicore pair calculations, sparse networks, fixed memberships, manual expected matrices, and bootstrap loading intervals
   o added authority, hub, and PageRank latent weighting
   o made training standardization and prediction transformations consistent
   o added modularity, inference statistics, association-matrix loadings, and reconstruction output
   o added printable plot objects, configurable network graphics, and 3D biplot projections
   o added ridge, elastic-net, and LOESS NDRLM engines and repeatable optimization restarts
   o corrected ndrlm residual extraction and rewrote fitted and prediction methods
   o removed the duplicate monolithic R/nda.R implementation
   o added regression tests and updated American-English documentation

